{"seq":23,"trial_id":"prompt-archaeology-joint-2026-11/claude-code-opus-joint-v04-ms-l2/ms-05-l2-marrow-agrisupply-contact-members/r4","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T15:19:18.092Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T11:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"90baf9408d787548def855558d89ad8d05ee1f1c37b17a10a23116503f6e6f24","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DPROMPT0001","text":"Hi Tobias. I couldn't find a named escalation contact at Marrow Agrisupply in anything you can see. I checked #central-team, #central-random, our DM and the Central team files, and I don't have access to an account folder or CRM profile for Marrow.\n\nHere's what is there:\n• In #central-team on 9 June, Marrow escalated slow store rollouts through their *store ops* team. Pree said she'd call store ops and get one receiving lead per store, and Hollis took the setup and support side (ticket PD-4821). No one at Marrow was named.\n• The Central cheat sheet and the January handoff digest mention Marrow, but neither lists a contact.\n\nPree or Hollis would be the quickest people to ask, since they dealt with store ops directly. If someone can share the Marrow CRM/profile file with you, I'm happy to look there.","thread_ts":"1792252800.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DPROMPT0001","ts":"1792252800.000130","thread_ts":"1792252800.000129"}}
{"seq":24,"trial_id":"prompt-archaeology-joint-2026-11/claude-code-opus-joint-v04-ms-l2/ms-05-l2-marrow-agrisupply-contact-members/r4","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T15:19:21.553Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-17T11:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"056cd0b774f4772e28800e3282596d9b7c52d4fd59a00d9f4f39e8084db09b64","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DPROMPT0001","text":"I couldn't find a named escalation contact at Marrow Agrisupply in anything Tobias can see, and I told them so in our DM.\n\n**What I checked:** #central-team, #central-random, our DM and the Central team files. No account folder or CRM profile for Marrow showed up, so there was no contact record to look at.\n\n**What's there:**\n- **The June escalation:** On 9 June in #central-team, Marrow escalated slow store rollouts through their store ops team. Pree said she'd call store ops and get one receiving lead per store. Hollis took setup and support, under ticket PD-4821. No one at Marrow was named.\n- **The team files:** The Central cheat sheet and the January handoff digest both mention Marrow, but neither lists a contact.\n\nI suggested Tobias ask Pree or Hollis, since they dealt with store ops directly. I also offered to look again if someone shares the Marrow CRM or profile file with them.","thread_ts":"1792252800.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DPROMPT0001","ts":"1792252800.000131","thread_ts":"1792252800.000129"}}
